 * </pre>

 * <p>

 * Conversion to Kotlin and from there to Java in 2012.

 * </p>

 * <p>

 * The C style comments are from the original C code, the ones with "//" from the port.

 * </p>

 * <p>

 * This class is immutable and thread-safe.

 * </p>

 *

 * @since 1.7

