    }



    /**

     * See {@link #apr1Crypt(String, String)} for details.

     * <p>

     * A salt is generated for you using {@link SecureRandom}

     * </p>

     *

     * @param keyBytes The plaintext bytes to hash. Each array element is set to {@code 0} before returning.

     * @param salt     An APR1 salt. The salt may be null, in which case a salt is generated for you using {@link SecureRandom}.

     * @return The hash value.

     * @throws IllegalArgumentException Thrown if the salt does not match the allowed pattern.

     * @throws IllegalArgumentException Thrown if a {@link NoSuchAlgorithmException} is caught.

