     * @param keyBytes The plaintext bytes to hash. Each array element is set to {@code 0} before returning.

     * @param salt     salt string including the prefix and optionally garbage at the end. The salt may be null, in which case a salt is generated for you using

     *                 {@link SecureRandom}.

