 * @see <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Daitch%E2%80%93Mokotoff_Soundex"> Wikipedia - Daitch-Mokotoff Soundex</a>

 * @see <a href="https://www.avotaynu.com/soundex.htm">Avotaynu - Soundexing and Genealogy</a>

 * @since 1.10

